{"timestamp":"2026-11-14T20:37:03.962Z","ordinal":279,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1db86-a51a-7763-8f16-5a729e09225d","turn_id":"01a1dbc1-59c0-7a41-a30f-7c85c2fa1732","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-f8e5dca2-0589-47d0-97f2-a19cde685b9a","server":"codex_app","tool":"read_thread","arguments":{"threadId":"019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15","turnLimit":8,"includeOutputs":false,"maxOutputCharsPerItem":2500},"pluginId":"codex-app-tools@openai-bundled","status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"schemaVersion\\\":1,\\\"thread\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"codex\\\",\\\"hostId\\\":\\\"local\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Describe el proyecto\\\",\\\"preview\\\":\\\"dime que entiendes del proyecto\\\",\\\"status\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"notLoaded\\\"},\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":1780442486,\\\"updatedAt\\\":1790689084},\\\"page\\\":{\\\"order\\\":\\\"newest_first\\\",\\\"limit\\\":8,\\\"nextCursor\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"requestedThreadId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"rolloutOrdinal\\\\\\\":4487,\\\\\\\"includeAnchor\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"scope\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"turns\\\\\\\"}}\\\",\\\"hasMore\\\":true},\\\"turns\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"01a0cc63-676f-7ac2-8890-6f7e767e6cc8\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":1790135461,\\\"completedAt\\\":1790135732,\\\"durationMs\\\":270507,\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"userMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"01a0cc63-6859-7dd2-8d40-7e8b52507398\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"hagamos el punto 2\\\\n\\\"}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34ca7e5ac8191aa912c06af7d5e40\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[\\\"**Planning recording management implementation**\\\"]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cabcfc48191b6400d0ce7a55561\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Perfecto, tomo “punto 2” como gestión de grabaciones/tomas. Voy a revisar cómo se guardan hoy las tomas y qué datos ya existen, porque ahí se decide si podemos agregar renombrar, eliminar, favoritos y exportar sin tocar el análisis de afinación.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_kpIQ12KRgEEot31yEyMmHbWZ\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"Get-Content audio\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\tomas.py\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":611},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_x2peO6dnUUdEaavnMxd3Oqzb\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"toma|take|takes|recording|voice|instrumental|favorite|favor|delete|eliminar|rename|nombre\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" audio desktop_live.py ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\index.html ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\styles.css\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":865},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_hIVGG4Up7wRQvxxCN8atir5i\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"Get-Content audio\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\catalogo.py\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":378},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_ne2E2uqMsmyKM5RiIar2Ip1t\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command 'Get-Content desktop_live.py | Select-Object -Index (130..230)'\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":327},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cb6d9388191829557c47c0edf1c\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cb762e48191b5f2c1e7d44d50a3\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Ya vi que las tomas tienen metadata JSON propia (`*_toma.json`) junto al WAV, así que podemos agregar gestión sin tocar el cálculo. Haré primero lo más útil y seguro: renombrar toma, marcar favorita y eliminar toma con confirmación. También dejaré el listado mostrando ese nombre/favorito.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_JqhRza2QlG4yHNU8nHCalV9s\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command 'Get-Content desktop_live.py | Select-Object -Index (490..545)'\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":256},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_PRjFHyrsCSbTf5Wm75cmYixK\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"Get-Content ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js | Select-Object -Index (430..470)\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":395},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_gYkMKIAh337JcTcaDnkFvM5d\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"Get-Content ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js | Select-Object -Index (580..630)\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":293},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_2TaJwmvWvtthGIL5g4g9UaOL\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"Get-Content ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js | Select-Object -Index (480..535)\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":361},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cc159008191b833bdd841a042a2\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_mX29yErEy2GcB4i9QAcMnuxD\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"usuario_|ruta_grabacion|sf.write|grabaciones\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" audio\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\karaoke.py audio\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":171},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cc6c8208191a785929671a5a498\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[\\\"**Designing WAV ID mapping functions**\\\",\\\"**Adding API methods for take management**\\\",\\\"**Designing reusable generic modal for take actions**\\\"]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cebb9608191abada78e267a640a\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Voy a añadir endpoints pequeños al backend para editar metadata de tomas y borrar sus archivos. Después conecto esos controles en el reproductor/listado de tomas con modales propios, para no volver a prompts nativos.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_MhGg7UcFgWfd1VPAxFrbVZxG\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\audio\\\\\\\\tomas.py\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cfb3ddc8191bc27cb1402aadef5\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34cfbebc88191a482709a6e00f9cd\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Backend de archivos de toma listo. Ahora expongo esas operaciones hacia la UI: editar nombre, alternar favorita y eliminar toma.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_FiEkX11XpO9r6rW6PHkBjAz1\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\desktop_live.py\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_e5qqQppTOBUKRDFDDj3U98MI\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\desktop_live.py\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d12ccfc8191a3fb53cda9ba6785\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Ahora incluyo `name` y `favorite` en lo que el backend envía al frontend. Eso deja la metadata visible sin recalcular nada.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_tiDQXaMm23T7XGZwcdCa8IRL\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\desktop_live.py\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d17998c81919dca7e0a3257ade0\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d17e5cc8191a27524266a77504e\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Paso a la interfaz: agregaré botones de gestión en el reproductor de tomas y un modal genérico para renombrar/confirmar eliminación sin usar `prompt` ni `confirm`.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_mXJtoKsF3RVde4wrzjyTpzin\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\index.html\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d252238819182c487a76f9b0580\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d256a04819196813a62344e8b85\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Voy a conectar esos nuevos elementos en JS y actualizar cómo se ven las tarjetas de tomas para mostrar nombre personalizado y marca de favorita.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_UbGMUM5Zvu6VR0Lcl0pL29It\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\app.js\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_bPFPwlr5mqlmw18gxk4qsCoT\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\app.js\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":n