":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\app.js\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d7b1a308191a5d9837421a157e2\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d7c11cc8191a14b326318ec1a17\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Ahora conecto los botones nuevos a esas acciones.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_HmJXPquYZT4wDdnlbisigvtc\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\app.js\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d8323a88191a39005c3bb21b5e9\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d838e888191a963b25958d5845e\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Me falta pulir el estilo de los nuevos estados en la lista de tomas y del mensaje del modal.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_arKbq64EYiKTOg0hPy7QEAEG\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\styles.css\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d8e54a88191868a08f1bde5febe\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[\\\"**Verifying modal class toggling and take deletion effects**\\\"]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0b97e77e51b7b4ea016ab34d9454f08191a393447b645ed361\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Voy a validar todo: sintaxis JS, compilación Python e ids del HTML. Luego reviso rápido las referencias nuevas para detectar errores de nombre.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_JrXEbC4Hozq2rmom5rk1hCNu\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"node --check ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":314},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_DdnTJIjIQY65Kb776wvvXKQj\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command 'py -3.10 -m compileall desktop_live.py audio'\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":371},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_7PHdjosybzEoNdEUdB6XEEjY\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command '$html = Get-Content ui_live'\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\index.html -Raw; \\\\\\\"'$js = Get-Content ui_live'\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js -Raw; \\\\\\\"'$ids = [regex]::Matches($js, '\\\\\\\"'getElementById\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"([\\\\\\\"'^\\\\\\\"]+)\\\\\\\"'\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\)') | ForEach-Object { \\\\\\\"'$_.Groups[1].Value } | Sort-Object -Unique; $missing = $ids | Where-Object { $html -notmatch ('\\\\\\\"'id=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"' + [regex]::Escape(\\\\\\\"'$_) + '\\\\\\\"'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"') }; if (\\\\\\\"'$missing) { $missing } else { '\\\\\\\"'OK: todos los getElementById tienen id en index.html' }\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\":0,\\\"durationMs\\\":377},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"commandExecution\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_yeuH4HYwKbmw5xxGDLfm7V9G\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.cache\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\dependencies\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\native\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\powershell\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\pwsh.exe\\\\\\\" -Command \\\\\\\"rg -n \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"edit_take|set_take_favorite|delete_take|actualizar_toma|eliminar_toma|takeRenameButton|takeFavoriteButton|takeDeleteButton|genericModal|favorite|Favorita\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" desktop_live.py audio\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\tomas.py ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\app.js ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\index.html ui_live\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\styles.css\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"cwd\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"exitCode\\\"…17721 tokens truncated…\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\app.js\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-740\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Mido otra vez el efecto: quiero ver falsos altos bajar más, con La4 intacto.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-741\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Mucho mejor: los puntos sobre Si4 bajaron de `1416` a `143`, y La4 se mantiene. Quedan algunos máximos aislados; voy a listar esos restos para decidir si se eliminan como ruido corto.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-742\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[\\\"**Evaluating segment removal criteria**\\\",\\\"**Defining rules for removing suspicious segments**\\\"]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-743\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Quedan dos grupos altos; uno es extremo y corto, típico de falso positivo. Voy a añadir una limpieza suave de segmentos imposibles: no corrige ni elimina La4, solo descarta grupos muy altos, breves y lejanos del contexto.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_U6lJmtLa0Siu5NSg5cc5DM69\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\audio\\\\\\\\pitch.py\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-744\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Como ahora la capa corregida puede tener menos puntos que la filtrada, ajusto el conteo de octavas para comparar por tiempo y no asumir que ambas listas tienen el mismo largo.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_xg41BSbCzLpfqy2Ij2UIcYgR\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\audio\\\\\\\\karaoke.py\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-745\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Aplico la misma limpieza en la referencia ya cargada por la UI, para que no tengas que reprocesar solo para ver el gráfico más limpio.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"fileChange\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"call_s1ltA4lNcJgyKc0LZIoq8eo3\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"changes\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Diego Tapia\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\Pene\\\\\\\\U\\\\\\\\Tesis\\\\\\\\tesis_karaoke\\\\\\\\ui_live\\\\\\\\app.js\\\",\\\"kind\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"update\\\",\\\"move_path\\\":null}}]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-746\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Voy a medir de nuevo el resultado del postproceso completo: filtrado, corregido y limpieza.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-747\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"El postproceso ahora baja los falsos altos de `1416` a `107` puntos, mantiene La4, y el máximo queda bastante más razonable. Ahora reviso que la vista nueva y el backend sigan conectando bien.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-748\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[\\\"**Investigating reference disappearance bug**\\\"]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-749\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"El backend responde bien y la UI tiene todos los IDs conectados. No ejecuté “Reprocesar” por ti para no sobrescribir la referencia sin que lo pidas, pero el botón ahora recalculará con esta lógica nueva.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-750\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[\\\"**Drafting concise Spanish final response**\\\"]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"agentMessage\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"item-751\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Terminé el ajuste. Lo que hice apunta justo a los dos síntomas:\\\\n\\\\n- La referencia que desaparecía mientras cantabas: cambié el cálculo del eje vertical para que el gráfico se ancle primero en las notas de referencia visibles, y no en picos raros de la voz del usuario. Está en [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:956>).\\\\n- Las notas raras del diagnóstico: ahora las líneas se cortan cuando hay saltos grandes de pitch, así no se dibujan paredes/diagonales falsas entre notas lejanas. Está en [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:712>).\\\\n- Afiné la corrección de octavas: conserva La4, baja grupos altos que calzan mejor una octava abajo, y descarta segmentos extremos breves. Está en [audio/pitch.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/pitch.py:182>).\\\\n\\\\nEn la canción problemática medí esto:\\\\n- Antes del postproceso: `1416` puntos sobre Si4.\\\\n- Después: `107` puntos sobre Si4.\\\\n- Los puntos cerca de La4 se conservaron: `74`.\\\\n\\\\nValidé JS, IDs HTML/JS, compilación Python y la llamada real del diagnóstico.\\\\n\\\\nImportante: el gráfico normal ya aplica la limpieza visual al cargar la referencia, pero para actualizar el archivo `ref_pitch.csv` con esta lógica nueva tienes que pulsar **Reprocesar** una vez en esa canción.\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}]}]}\"}],\"isError\":false}}}\n{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":\"Codex CLI | ChatGPT Learn (https://developers.openai.com/codex/cli/features/ ; rewritten summary of https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli)\\nciteturn2view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\\\"ref_id\\\":\\\"turn1view0\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"resume\\\"}); Redirected to URL: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/codex/cli; Total lines: 1136\\nL1090: ### Review changes before they ship\\nL1091: \\nL1092: Run a dedicated review against uncommitted changes, a commit, or a base branch. Codex reports prioritized findings without modifying your working tree, so you can address risks before you commit or open a pull request.\\nL1093: \\nL1094: 【563†Learn more】\\nL1095: \\nL1096: Select a review preset\\nL1097: \\nL1098: ›1.Review against a base branch(PR Style)\\nL1099: \\nL1100: 2.Review uncommitted changes\\nL1101: \\nL1102: 3.Review a commit\\nL1103: \\nL1104: 4.Custom review instructions\\nL1105: ## Build a terminal workflow around Codex\\nL1106: \\nL1107: Learn about the CLI features you can use to resume sessions, add visual and web context, split up complex work, and connect Codex to your development tools.\\nL1108: 【564†01 ` codex resume ` Return to a saved chat Reopen a recent chat from the current repository, or search across local chats when you need to return to older work.】 【565†02 ` codex --image ` Bring visual context into the prompt Pass an error screenshot, architecture diagram, or design reference with the first prompt, or paste an image into the interactive composer.】 【381†03 ` subagents ` Split up a larger investigation Ask Codex to delegate focused work to specialized agents, then bring their findings back into the main terminal session.】 【566†04 ` codex --search ` Search for current context Switch a run to live web search when a task depends on current releases, documentation, or external behavior.\\nL1109: Search activity stays visible in the transcript.】 【567†05 ` codex cloud ` Move work to Codex cloud Browse active and completed chats, submit work to a configured environment, and apply the result to your local repository from the terminal.】 【568†06 ` codex mcp ` Connect external tools with MCP Add local or remote MCP servers, authenticate when needed, and inspect the tools available to the current session before Codex uses them.】 【414†07 ` /permissions ` Set the boundaries for each run Choose when Codex can edit files or run commands without asking, and inspect the active sandbox and writable roots before you continue.】 【408†08 ` codex completion ` Fit Codex to your terminal Generate completions for your shell, choose a syntax theme, and open longer prompts in the editor configured by VISUAL or EDITOR.】\\n--------------------------------------------------------